## What checks it

`composer verify` (CI Gate 0) regenerates this app's composition, facts and report and fails on
drift — and refuses a manifest whose declaration is incomplete — and
`arch_check` R10 fails if anything under `lib/` other than `injection.dart` imports a module.
CI Gate 3 runs `test/di_smoke_test.dart`, which boots this app's real DI graph for every flavor —
so a missing registration or a DI ordering mistake in this composition fails the PR. CI builds no
binary of it: the build job builds `apps/mobile` only.
